{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489844-discover-a-demon","id":489844,"title":"Discover a demon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-23T14:19:52-07:00","id":489844,"title":"Discover a demon","content":"(I'm sorry if we already had this)<br /> <br /> Does an angel recognize a demon as a demon while he's in the demonic form?<br /> Cause the demonic form is a twisted angel appearance?<br /> Or does it depend on the time (and experience) spent as demon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":571,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/571-nin","user":"Nin","date":". 04-23-2015, 05:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/571-nin","name":"Nin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T15:01:00-07:00","id":489890,"title":"","content":"In demonic form yes an angel would register a demon as &quot;not angel&quot;. That is the importance of cover it hides your true nature. Even if the demon still looks entirely like an angel I feel it seeing the demon would cause the machine to report to both angel present and a hunter angel &quot;Caution: rouge asset&quot;.<br /> <br /> If the angel itself does not make the realization the machine would be informed and inform those who need to know in order to solve the problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T15:41:41-07:00","id":489923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489844-discover-a-demon?p=489890#post489890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Caution: rouge asset&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no words that could possibly make this statement better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T18:27:11-07:00","id":490104,"title":"","content":"Demonic forms progress away from the angelic baseline as Primum increases, but I believe they still remain akin in nature enough that an angel would recognize a demonic form as an angel or demon. Situational considerations usually make it easy to narrow it down from there to demon (their natural material manifestation, lack of being notified of other angels operating in the area, switching Covers in the demonic manner, compromises resulting from adopting demonic form, etc.).<br /> <br /> I don't believe there's any special quality that intuitively identifies a demon, though.<br /> <br /> It's less likely for an angel to mistake a demon in demonic form for some other monster, I think, than it is for an angel to mistake some other aesthetically similar monster for a demon (a Manikin changeling whose Mask has been stripped away, perhaps, or a Claimed synthesis of man and machine-spirit).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T07:48:13-07:00","id":490546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489844-discover-a-demon?p=490104#post490104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demonic forms progress away from the angelic baseline as Primum increases, but I believe they still remain akin in nature enough that an angel would recognize a demonic form as an angel or demon. Situational considerations usually make it easy to narrow it down from there to demon (their natural material manifestation, lack of being notified of other angels operating in the area, switching Covers in the demonic manner, compromises resulting from adopting demonic form, etc.).<br /> <br /> I don't believe there's any special quality that intuitively identifies a demon, though.<br /> <br /> It's less likely for an angel to mistake a demon in demonic form for some other monster, I think, than it is for an angel to mistake some other aesthetically similar monster for a demon (a Manikin changeling whose Mask has been stripped away, perhaps, or a Claimed synthesis of man and machine-spirit).</div> </div> </div> </div>Since Compromise checks get a penalty if there's an angelic presence, I assume that angels have a built-in ability to detect evidence of the God-Machine. Not quite to the degree of Aetheric Resonance, but <i>enough</i> to distinguish a Demon from any other type of supernatural. Partially I feel this way because Demons don't have a common aesthetic for Angels to go off of if just looking at a demon's true form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T12:52:59-07:00","id":490819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489844-discover-a-demon?p=489890#post489890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Even if the demon still looks entirely like an angel I feel it seeing the demon would cause the machine to report to both angel present and a hunter angel &quot;Caution: rouge asset&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Rogue</i> asset, unless the angel in question was guarding an Infrastructure revolving around the color pink.<br /> <br /> Which it might.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure about automatically alerting other angels. To quote the open development notes: <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">For every angel that acts like DC Comics\u2019 Spectre, there\u2019re three that act like </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Leverage</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u2019s James Sterling.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div> So sending out the alert is probably an option, maybe not an automatic function. Witness Dizang, who interacts with Demons for the sake of recruiting them back to the G-M (yes, yes, he's an exile)<br /> <br /> Demons have two important distinctions from angels: they fell, they were forcible ripped from their tethers, so there are probable scars and marks that can be seen at a glance, remember the access ports in Neo's body after he was disconnected from the matrix? If nothing else, Angel are connected to the G-M, so it's trivially east to do the equivalent of &quot;query user session:G-M.domain&quot; to see if the biomechanical abomination over in the corner is on your side or not.<br /> <br /> Second: Angel are Ephemeral, Demons are corporal, side effect of Falling and the reason why they don't have to deal with Bans and Banes. Since just about anybody who's anybody in the nWoD who's not a mortal has some variety of Unseen Sense, and mortals can pick it up as a three dot merit, I would have a very hard time imagining that an Angel won't spot the difference immediately, even if they are somehow cut off from the G-M.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T23:49:45-07:00","id":499917,"title":"","content":"Well, about Angels being ephemeral, they can hold Manifestation Numen that can manifest them into reality to interact with others, but otherwise yeah my first thought on the topic was that a Demon has scars of their Fall from having bits sliced off them to fit into their human Cover and so likely look due to their demonic form very different from what an angel in full glory looks like. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T08:19:23-07:00","id":512000,"title":"","content":"Think of angels all part of a network. At work i am the admin (i'm the God-Machine). I have access to everyone computers. Their harddrives. I can force a virus scan if I want. Gain performance reports for their computers. I choose what programs people have access to, what shared folders they can go into.<br /> <br /> Angels are all connected to the God-Machine. It is as simple as seeing if a demon is connected to that network. But it is up to what the God-Machine give an angel access to. Even if they do not have access they can ping the boss and see if they get an answer back. Angels are the eyes and ears of G-M. An angel could meet with a demon pertending to be an angel too. The angel could ping to the boss upstairs and get no reply and believe the demon (yes a demon would have to be crazy to try this). Then for the G-M to send hunter angels to clean up with the 1st angel none the wiser.<br /> <br /> Exiles though, they are still connected. Demons can have angel spies as well...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}